reads/aqualyx-guide.1716006/"},{"title":"aqualyx vs liposuction for subq cheek fat","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-vs-liposuction-for-subq-cheek-fat.1682098/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218090701/https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-vs-liposuction-for-subq-cheek-fat.1682098/"},{"title":"if youre interested in aqualyx please read","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/if-youre-interested-in-aqualyx-please-read.1973456/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407023223/https://looksmax.org/threads/if-youre-interested-in-aqualyx-please-read.1973456/"},{"title":"someone stole my aqualyx diy","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/someone-stole-my-aqualyx-diy.1941774/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407022649/https://looksmax.org/threads/someone-stole-my-aqualyx-diy.1941774/"},{"title":"second aqualyx session 3ml per cheek motivation","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/second-aqualyx-session-3ml-per-cheek-motivation.1939940/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407023231/https://looksmax.org/threads/second-aqualyx-session-3ml-per-cheek-motivation.1939940/"},{"title":"my diy aqualyx experience tutorial","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/my-diy-aqualyx-experience-tutorial.1925115/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407022702/https://looksmax.org/threads/my-diy-aqualyx-experience-tutorial.1925115/"},{"title":"how to tell between fake vs real aqualyx","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-tell-between-fake-vs-real-aqualyx.1897518/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407023254/https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-tell-between-fake-vs-real-aqualyx.1897518/"},{"title":"how do i use aqualyx","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/how-do-i-use-aqualyx.1835101/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260209073823/https://looksmax.org/threads/how-do-i-use-aqualyx.1835101/"},{"title":"everything you need to know about aqualyx","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/everything-you-need-to-know-about-aqualyx.1827084/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260224070231/https://looksmax.org/threads/everything-you-need-to-know-about-aqualyx.1827084/"},{"title":"experiment i injected aqualyx wrong on purpose","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/experiment-i-injected-aqualyx-wrong-on-purpose.1823859/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260308002509/https://looksmax.org/threads/experiment-i-injected-aqualyx-wrong-on-purpose.1823859/"},{"title":"i fucked up an aqualyx injection what to do now","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/i-fucked-up-an-aqualyx-injection-what-to-do-now.1800807/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260208094719/https://looksmax.org/threads/i-fucked-up-an-aqualyx-injection-what-to-do-now.1800807/"},{"title":"give me aqualyx source now","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/give-me-aqualyx-source-now.1788639/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229141032/https://looksmax.org/threads/give-me-aqualyx-source-now.1788639/"},{"title":"just did aqualyx on my cheeks","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/just-did-aqualyx-on-my-cheeks.1787042/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260119115402/https://looksmax.org/threads/just-did-aqualyx-on-my-cheeks.1787042/"},{"title":"looking to buy aqualyx","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/looking-to-buy-aqualyx.1784454/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228173210/https://looksmax.org/threads/looking-to-buy-aqualyx.1784454/"}],"web":[{"title":"Aqualyx — Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Aqualyx"},{"title":"Deoxycholic acid (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deoxycholic_acid"}]},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Aqualyx","lead":["Aqualyx is a gel-like aqueous solution of sodium deoxycholate, developed in Italy by Professor Pasquale Motolese and commercially available since 2009, marketed by Marllor and sold to doctors and nurses trained in intralipotherapy [1][2]. It is CE-marked in the European Union and used for localized subcutaneous fat [2][1].","Deoxycholic acid is a naturally occurring bile acid; the US FDA has approved a different deoxycholic acid product, Kybella, for submental fat [3]. Aqualyx has no FDA approval [2].","Published studies of Aqualyx are limited. One empirical study examined ultrasound-guided injection for lipomas [4], and a case report described chronic infection and nodules after a deoxycholate injection [1]. In looksmaxxing forums it is discussed for slimming the lower face and neck, an application no published trial has evaluated."],"infobox":[["Active ingredient","Sodium deoxycholate"],["Route","Subcutaneous injection"],["Developer","Prof. Pasquale Motolese (Italy) [1]"],["On market since","2009 [1]"],["Legal status","CE-marked (EU); not FDA-approved [2]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Uses","paras":["Per Grokipedia, intended targets are small, pinchable pockets of fat such as the chin, abdomen, flanks and thighs [2]. Practitioner-led treatment is described as multiple sessions spaced weeks apart [2]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Pharmacology","paras":["Deoxycholic acid disrupts the lipid membranes of fat cells, releasing their contents and prompting an inflammatory response in which macrophages clear debris, followed by fibrosis [2]. The US label-approved relative is Kybella, which Wikipedia describes as destroying submental fat cells over several months [3]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Adverse effects","paras":["Grokipedia lists swelling, bruising and discomfort as common, with infection and nodules reported in some cases [2]. A 2022 case report described chronic infection and nodule formation after injection of an advertised deoxycholate product, noting Aqualyx is sold only to trained clinicians [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Use in looksmaxxing communities","paras":["Users on looksmax.org post threads about price, authenticity and results, with some reporting a persistent hollow look after cheek and neck treatment and others discussing swelling after injection [5]. Threads include warnings about counterfeit products and disputes about whether the outcome is permanent. The wiki does not reproduce dosing or technique details."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["A study of ultrasound-guided Aqualyx injection reported on lipoma removal [4]. A 2022 case report documented chronic infection and nodule formation after deoxycholate injection [1]. No published studies were found on Aqualyx for facial hollowing or buccal fat reduction."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Aqualyx is discussed on looksmax.org as a cheap route to a leaner face, with threads on sourcing, authenticity and results [5].","claims":[{"claim":"Aqualyx gives a permanent hollow-cheek look.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Aqualyx destroys fat cells permanently.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Self-injected or imported product is equivalent to clinic treatment.","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[{"year":"2009","event":"Aqualyx becomes commercially available [1]."},{"year":"2019","event":"Study of ultrasound-guided Aqualyx injection for lipomas published [4]."},{"year":"2022","event":"Case report of chronic infection and nodules after deoxycholate injection [1]."}],"refs":[{"title":"Chronic infection and nodule formation following deoxycholate injection","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35832164/","source":"Archives of Plastic Surgery","year":2022,"type":"study"},{"title":"Aqualyx","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Aqualyx","source":"Grokipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Deoxycholic acid","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deoxycholic_acid","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Lipoma removal using a high-frequency ultrasound-guided injection of a Class III CE-marked device","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30027646/","source":"Journal of Cosmetic Dermatology","year":2019,"type":"study"},{"title":"Aqualyx results","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-results.1954769/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[{"title":"Chronic infection and nodule formation following deoxycholate injection","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35832164/","source":"Archives of Plastic Surgery","year":2022,"kind":null},{"title":"Lipoma removal using a high-frequency ultrasound-guided injection of a Class III CE-marked device","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30027646/","source":"Journal of Cosmetic Dermatology","year":2019,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Aqualyx price ?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-price.2006014/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260429143147/https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-price.2006014/"},{"title":"Aqualyx Hyoid/Double Chin Tutorial w/ PICS","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-hyoid-double-chin-tutorial-w-pics.1979503/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407023150/https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-hyoid-double-chin-tutorial-w-pics.1979503/"},{"title":"Aqualyx Results","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-results.1954769/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407022643/https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-results.1954769/"},{"title":"aqualyx bam15 results","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-bam15-results.1949392/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407023251/https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-bam15-results.1949392/"},{"title":"aqualyx diy tutorial malar pads","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-diy-tutorial-malar-pads.1937382/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260407022611/https://looksmax.org/threads/aqualyx-diy-tutorial